            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "E. Member Focused Care positions will be posted. Qualified employees will be awarded such positions based upon bargaining unit seniority. It is understood that employees can only bid on \"like\" hours positions (i.e., 24 to",
